{"sections":[{"slug":"对称序列","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"对称序列"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称序列</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"对称序列"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对称序列是一种可用于定义</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的结构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对称序列可视为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/解析函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">多项式函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">系数</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">对称序列上有一个幺半结构和一个对称幺半结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">分别对应多项式函子的复合与乘积</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑有限集合与双射构成的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq}$, <span lang=\"zh\">配备无交并构成对称幺半范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">它是由一个对象生成的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自由-遗忘伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">它也是所有有限</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的无交并</span>:\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq} \\simeq \\bigsqcup_{n\\geq 0} \\mathbf{B}S_n.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的对称序列是函子</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq} \\to \\mathcal C.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">给出一个对称序列就是对每个</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出对称群</span> $S_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表示</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与自函子的关系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设对称幺半范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">有合适的余极限</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">那么对称序列</span> $F\\colon \\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq} \\to \\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的自函子</span>\n$$\r\nX\\mapsto \\bigsqcup_{n\\geq 0} F(n)\\otimes_{S_n}X^{\\otimes n} = \\int_{\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq}}F(n)\\otimes X^{\\otimes n},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">且该函子为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/解析函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">解析函子</span>"}},{"Plain":".\n<span lang=\"zh\">这个函子可以如下理解</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由于</span> $\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个对象生成的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自由-遗忘伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出一个对称幺半函子</span> $\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq}\\to\\mathcal C, n\\mapsto X^{\\otimes n}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $F,G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是两个对称序列</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们计算它们对应的自函子的复合</span>:\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\nX&amp;\\mapsto\r\n\\bigsqcup_{n\\ge 0} F(n) \\otimes_{S_n}\r\n\\Big(\r\n\\bigsqcup_{m\\ge 0} G(m) \\otimes_{S_m}\r\nX^{\\otimes m}\r\n\\Big)\r\n^{\\otimes n}\\\\\r\n&amp;\\simeq\\bigsqcup_{n\\geq 0} F(n) \\otimes_{S_n}\r\n\\bigsqcup_{(m_i)_{i=1}^n}\r\n\\bigotimes_{i=1}^n(G(m_i)\\otimes_{S_{m_i}}X^{\\otimes m_i})\\\\\r\n&amp;\\simeq\r\n\\bigsqcup_{\\ell\\geq 0}\\bigsqcup_{n,m_1+\\cdots + m_n = \\ell}\\big(F(n)\\otimes\\bigotimes_{i=1}^n G(m_i)\\big)\\otimes\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半结构</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设对称幺半范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/和(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余积</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $X\\otimes -$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持余积</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">那么对称序列上还有一个由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Day卷积","text":"Day <span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">给出的对称幺半结构</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">具体地</span>,\n$$\r\n(X\\otimes Y)_n = \\bigsqcup_{p+q=n} \\operatorname{Ind}_{\\Sigma_p\\times\\Sigma_q}^{\\Sigma_n} (X_p\\otimes Y_q).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\operatorname{Ind}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是沿</span> $\\Sigma_p\\times \\Sigma_q\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/诱导表示","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">诱导表示</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">即限制表示的左伴随</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">泛性质</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对称序列的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Seq}:=\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq},\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是由一个对象生成的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自由-遗忘伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它是遗忘函子</span> $U\\colon \\mathcal C\\text{-}\\mathsf{Cat}^{\\text{SymMon}} \\to \\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的表示对象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">因此由</span> $(\\infty,2)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴版本的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/米田引理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田引理</span>"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\mathsf{Seq} &amp;\\simeq \\mathsf{Fun}^{\\text{SymMon}}(\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Seq}) \\\\&amp;\\simeq \\operatorname{End}(U).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这给出其上的复合幺半结构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自由-遗忘伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">遗忘伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一般现象</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">固定一个域</span> $k$, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathsf{Vect}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性空间范畴的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". $\\mathsf{Vect}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的对称序列构成的范畴</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Vect}^\\Sigma:= \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathsf{Fin}^{\\simeq},\\mathsf{Vect}) \\simeq \\prod_{n\\geq 1} \\mathsf{Rep}(\\Sigma_n)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是一个对象生成的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自由-遗忘伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>"}},{"Plain":" "},{"Local":{"url":"/微分分次范畴","text":"DG <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Gaitsgory–RozenblyumDAG","text":"Gaitsgory–Rozenblyum <span lang=\"zh\">导出代数几何讲义</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">关于</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数与</span> Koszul <span lang=\"zh\">对偶的一节</span>).</p>\n"}]}}}]}